	(1604, 'id', 1, 'publicsitefileswarning2', 'Note: Files placed here can be accessed by anyone who knows (or can guess) the URL. For security reasons, it is recommended that any backup files are deleted immediately after restoring them.', 'Catatan: Berkas yang ditempatkan di sini bisa diakses oleh siapa pun yang tahu (atau bisa menebak) URL. Demi keamanan, disarankan agar semua berkas cadangan dihapus segera setelah memulihkannya.', NULL, 1785718228, NULL, 0, 0),
