	(6282, 'id', 21, 'completedwarningtext', 'This activity is marked as done for one or more students. If you unlock the settings to make a change then save the form, completion data will be deleted then recalculated where possible. Manual completion can\'t be recalculated, so in this case the student will need to mark it as done again.', 'Aktivitas ini ditandai selesai untuk satu atau beberapa siswa. Jika Anda membuka kunci setelan untuk melakukan perubahan lalu menyimpan formulir, data penyelesaian akan dihapus lalu dihitung ulang kembali.', NULL, 1785718235, NULL, 0, 0),
