	(10319, 'id', 46, 'sendfollowinginfo_help', 'The following information will be sent to Moodle each time your site registration is updated (by default weekly, when the \'Site registration\' scheduled task is run). The information contributes to overall statistics only and will not be made public on any site listing. In addition, your Moodle release version is recorded by the weekly automated site link check.', 'Informasi berikut akan dikirim ke Moodle setiap kali pendaftaran situs Anda diperbarui (secara bawaan setiap minggu, ketika tugas terjadwal \'Pendaftaran situs\' dijalankan). Informasi hanya berkontribusi pada statistik keseluruhan dan tidak akan dipublikasikan di daftar situs mana pun. Selain itu, versi rilis Moodle Anda dicatat oleh pemeriksaan tautan situs otomatis mingguan.', NULL, 1785718240, NULL, 0, 0),
	(10320, 'id', 46, 'sent', '...finished', '... selesai', NULL, 1785718240, NULL, 0, 0),
