	(15764, 'id', 105, 'shuffleanswers_help', 'If enabled, the order of the answers is randomly shuffled for each attempt, provided that "Shuffle within questions" in the activity settings is also enabled.', 'Jika diaktifkan, urutan jawaban diacak untuk setiap upaya, asalkan "Acak dalam soal" di setelan aktivitas juga diaktifkan.', NULL, 1785718249, NULL, 0, 0),
