	(16426, 'id', 112, 'quickgrading_help', 'Quick grading allows you to assign grades (and outcomes) directly in the submissions table. Quick grading is not compatible with advanced grading and is not recommended when there are multiple markers.', 'Penilaian cepat memungkinkan Anda menetapkan nilai (dan capaian) langsung di tabel pengajuan. Penilaian cepat tidak kompatibel dengan penilaian lanjutan dan tidak disarankan jika ada beberapa poin nilai.', NULL, 1785718250, NULL, 0, 0),
