	(18565, 'id', 120, 'indicator:cognitivedepthdef_help', 'The participant has reached this percentage of the cognitive engagement offered by the Forum activities during this analysis interval (Levels = No view, View, Submit, View feedback, Comment on feedback, Resubmit after viewing feedback)', 'Peserta telah mencapai persentase keterlibatan kognitif ini yang ditawarkan oleh aktivitas Forum selama interval analisis ini (Tingkatan = Tidak ada tampilan, Lihat, Ajukan, Lihat umpan balik, Komentari umpan balik, Ajukan ulang setelah melihat umpan balik)', NULL, 1785718253, NULL, 0, 0),
