	(19304, 'id', 122, 'grade_grademethod_help', 'When using point grading, the following methods are available for calculating the final grade:\n\n* Highest grade of all attempts\n* Average (mean) grade of all attempts\n* First attempt (all other attempts are ignored)\n* Last attempt (all other attempts are ignored)\n* Don\'t use attempts for grading (disable grading calculation)', 'Saat menggunakan penilaian poin, metode berikut tersedia untuk menghitung nilai akhir: * Nilai tertinggi dari semua upaya * Nilai rata-rata (rata-rata) dari semua upaya * Upaya pertama (semua upaya lainnya diabaikan) * Upaya terakhir (semua upaya lainnya diabaikan ) * Jangan gunakan upaya penilaian (nonaktifkan perhitungan penilaian)', NULL, 1785718254, NULL, 0, 0),
