	(26651, 'id', 307, 'skydrivefilesexist', 'The Microsoft SkyDrive repository is enabled but it has been deprecated. Please ensure you migrate files from SkyDrive to the OneDrive repository as soon as possible. In Moodle 4.4 it will no longer be possible.', 'Repositori Microsoft SkyDrive diaktifkan tetapi tidak digunakan lagi. Pastikan Anda memigrasikan berkas dari SkyDrive ke repositori OneDrive sesegera mungkin. Jika tidak, pada Moodle 4.4 tidak dapat dipergunakan lagi.', NULL, 1785718284, NULL, 0, 0),
