	(27268, 'id', 360, 'evaluationinbatches', 'The site contents are calculated and stored in batches. The evaluation process may be stopped at any time. The next time it is run, it will continue from the point when it was stopped.', 'Konten situs dihitung dan disimpan dalam kumpulan. Proses evaluasi dapat dihentikan sewaktu-waktu. Lain kali dijalankan, itu akan berlanjut dari titik ketika dihentikan.', NULL, 1785718288, NULL, 0, 0),
