	(27624, 'id', 364, 'intro', 'This report shows, for a particular capability, what permission that capability has in the definition of every role (or a selection of roles), and everywhere in the site where that capability is overridden.', 'Laporan ini menunjukkan, untuk kapabilitas tertentu, izin apa yang dimiliki kapabilitas tersebut dalam definisi setiap peran (atau pilihan peran), dan di mana pun di situs tempat kapabilitas tersebut diganti.', NULL, 1785718290, NULL, 0, 0),
